  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Umbral Skies 是一個結合 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> 與 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> 的融合模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">發現 Twilight Forest 的精靈小屋和井的多樣變體，其方塊經過精心替換，以完美匹配 Aether 獨特的方塊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從 The Aether 中的每個 BOSS 身上獲取戰利品，風格如同 Twilight Forest 的戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝備來自 Twilight Forest 各種材料的拳套。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/653/932/2023-03-01_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"692\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
